# macOS-only ssh_config keywords, symlinked to ~/.ssh/config.darwin by
# symlink.py (darwin only -- see the base config's Include). UseKeychain is
# an Apple OpenSSH fork addition; upstream OpenSSH, as shipped on Linux,
# aborts with "Bad configuration option" on the unknown keyword, which is
# why it can't live in the shared config file.
Host *
    UseKeychain yes
